{"text": "From: Student Activities AMC List [student-activities-amc@LISTS.UCDENVER.EDU] on behalf of\nWood, Terri [Terri. Vood@UCDENVER.EDU]\n\nSent: Wednesday, September 07, 2011 7:54 AM\nTo: student-activities-amc@LISTS.UCDENVER.EDU\nSubject: IMPORTANT UPDATE INFORMATION: Disability Dialogue, PMIG, Women's Health SAC\n\nevent location change this Thursday Sept 8t\n\nUpdated Location for September 8th Lunch Lecture on FAS presented by\nDisability Dialogue, PMIG, and Women\u2019s Health SAC\n\nThank you to everyone who RSVP\u2019d to the upcoming lunch lecture on Fetal\nAlcohol Syndrome presented by Disability Dialogue, PMIG, and Women\u2019s\nHealth SAC. Due to the overwhelming response of RSVP\u2019s we have moved to\na larger room, the Bushnell Auditorium in Bldg 500. We are already full for\nthat room and will not be accepting any further RSVP\u2019s. Thank you!\n\nUPDATED LOCATION:\nWhen: Thursday, September 8th\n12-12:50PM\nWhere: Bushnell Auditorium in Bldg 500\n\nThis message was distributed to the subscribers of the University of Colorado Denver \"student-activities-amc\"\nlist.\nIf you wish to unsubscribe, click the link below, and then send the resulting message:\n\nUnsubscribe student-activities-ame\n\nCU 03-000663",
